  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace Dividend Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project compliments the work of the Sudan Ecumenical Forum (SEF) and the Sudan Council of Churches (SCC) to facilitate people-to-people dialogue and promote conflict resolution. This 3-year project will provide micro-grants to community-based peace initiatives identified through State and County-level People-to-People (South-South) Dialogue Forums. This is designed to promote peaceful co-existence in communities. In continuing to play is role as the administrative agency of the implementing partner (SEF), CAFOD will closely be involved and jointly with SEF and SCC officials approve the micro peace dividend funds to specific communities as well as monitoring of the process at implementation level.</narrative>
  </description>
